+---
+id: lem-qftx-compact-torus-fixed-locus-normal-weights
+kind: lemma
+title: Fixed loci and normal weights of compact torus actions
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 0
+domain: mathematics
