+---
+id: lem-qftx-compact-torus-equivariant-slice-neighborhoods
+kind: lemma
+title: Equivariant tubular and slice neighborhoods for compact torus actions
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
