+  - def-countable-choice
+  - lem-qftx-compact-torus-fixed-locus-normal-weights
+  - thm-every-orbit-is-an-injectively-immersed-homogeneous-space
+  - thm-existence-uniqueness-and-smooth-dependence-of-geodesics
