+---
+id: lem-qftx-proper-closed-subgroup-has-annihilating-character
+kind: lemma
+title: A proper closed subgroup of a torus has a nonzero annihilating character
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 0
